{
  "an5.178:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 5.178 ",
  "an5.178:0.2": "18. A Lay Follower ",
  "an5.178:0.3": "Kings ",
  "an5.178:1.1": "“What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "an5.178:1.2": "Have you ever seen or heard ",
  "an5.178:1.3": "of a person who has given up killing living creatures, ",
  "an5.178:1.4": "and the kings have them arrested for that, and execute, imprison, or banish them, or do what the case requires?” ",
  "an5.178:1.5": "“No, sir.” ",
  "an5.178:1.6": "“Good, mendicants! ",
  "an5.178:1.7": "I too have never seen or heard of such a thing. ",
  "an5.178:1.8": "",
  "an5.178:1.9": "",
  "an5.178:1.10": "Rather, the kings are informed of someone’s bad deed: ",
  "an5.178:1.11": "‘This person has murdered a man or a woman.’ ",
  "an5.178:1.12": "The kings have them arrested for killing, and execute, imprison, or banish them, or do what the case requires. ",
  "an5.178:1.13": "Have you ever seen or heard of such a case?” ",
  "an5.178:1.14": "“Sir, we have seen it and heard of it, and we will hear of it again.” ",
  "an5.178:2.1": "“What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "an5.178:2.2": "Have you ever seen or heard ",
  "an5.178:2.3": "of a person who has given up stealing, ",
  "an5.178:2.4": "and the kings have them arrested for that …?” ",
  "an5.178:2.5": "“No, sir.” ",
  "an5.178:2.6": "“Good, mendicants! ",
  "an5.178:2.7": "I too have never seen or heard of such a thing. ",
  "an5.178:2.8": "",
  "an5.178:2.9": "",
  "an5.178:2.10": "Rather, the kings are inf